        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/i5_W9l5xpR8111suqUQO-7jNhX4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/21712-chocolate-covered-strawberries-ddmfs-Step2-1722-ca5c6ae908694a488839d53cd2131df8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/21712/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Insert toothpicks into tops (stem ends) of strawberries. Hold a strawberry by the toothpick and dip it into the chocolate mixture.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Kb7u2WGP-o2UbkfhTGK2N-j9T2M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/21712-chocolate-covered-strawberries-ddmfs-Step4-1727-33f6f745aa004ef8838475f610de67f0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/21712/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Turn the strawberry upside down and insert the toothpick into a Styrofoam block or place strawberry on a sheet of waxed paper; allow chocolate coating to cool. Repeat with remaining strawberries.",
